    </section><section class="panel"><h2>Manage academic data</h2><p>Use the course, subject, student, teacher, and assignment pages to manage available records. University, college, and semester data are prepared using the seed script.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/admin/courses">Courses</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/subjects">Subjects</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/teachers">Teachers</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/students">Students</a><a class="button secondary" href="/admin/assignments">Teaching assignments</a></div></section>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include("../partials/footer") %>
